.bd
halt
- stop the machine
.sp 2
.in -5
.bd
SYNTAX
.in +5
.br
.bd
halt
.sp 2
.in -5
.bd
DESCRIPTION
.in +5
.br
Halt calls the reboot system call with the RB_HALT flag, which drops
the cpu in kernel mode.  On real hardware this traps to the monitor;
the simulators end the run.
.sp
Only the super-user may halt the machine.
.sp 2
.in -5
.bd
